WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.840
'Naveen and Kamal
are working under me.'

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.120
'Guna hasn't come to the hospital
ever since his mother passed away.'

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.140
'So, Reena is the right choice.'

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.290
'Arjun, you are using your position
in a biased way in this hospital.'

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:12.770
'Yes, I am doing it for her.
It is a biased decision.'

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:16.410
'What is this?
- Divorce papers came in the post.'

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:17.920
'I swear to God.'

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.290
'Hereafter, only good things
will happen to you from now on.'

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.340
'Thank you, Vijay.'

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:23.840
'Hey, she is just
an intern after all.'

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:27.220
'Don't insult me
by posing her as a threat.'

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:30.690
'Don't underestimate what I can do
because I'm just an intern.'

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:34.280
'If I want something,
I will do anything for it.'

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.960
'Hello, are you her parent?'

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.640
'What if it's her sister?
- Why didn't you tell me?'

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:42.620
'Your problem is bigger than mine.'

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:44.280
'I am not a kid anymore.'

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.920
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:09.460
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:14.840
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:19.020
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:21.610
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:24.190
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:27.050
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:32.190
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.140
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:43.530
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:00.670
Reena, what is this?

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:02.080
Did Divi face any problem?

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:03.220
Who told you?

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:04.870
Is that important now?

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:07.250
What happened?
Is everything okay now?

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:08.710
Everything is solved.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:10.280
Why are you asking about it?

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:11.960
Why didn't you call me?

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:13.600
Why should I call you?

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.810
You could have taken me with you
if you had a problem.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:19.270
I am asking you again.
Why should I call you?

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.200
What is this, Reena?
Did you forget?

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:24.570
When you had a problem in the
police station that day.. - Hello.

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:27.460
That was your problem.
You dragged me into your problem.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.910
Okay.
But you saw my bravery, right?

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:33.040
So I thought you would call me.

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:34.250
No.

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:35.320
Arjun helped me.

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:36.400
Arjun?

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:38.940
Hey. Why are you getting
shocked now?

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:41.970
You knew Divi had a problem, but
you didn't know who I went with.

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:43.700
I was aware.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:46.710
So, are you back together now?

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:50.210
He is helping me as a friend.
And I am helping him.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:52.390
But you're imagining things.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.840
So, you are not together?

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:56.250
What is your problem?

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:57.920
How does it matter to you?

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.420
Won't you mind your own business?

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:01.700
Okay.
Sorry.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.590
Actually, I need a help.

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:08.960
As a friend.

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:10.500
Can't you help a friend?

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:12.000
What help?

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:13.610
Are you free tomorrow?

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:16.380
Why?
- Will you come for dinner with me?

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:18.420
Hey, you took me
to a tea shop the other day.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:21.290
Dinner again?
- No. Not just us.

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:23.470
Nilofer and her family are coming.

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:26.290
You are going with your family.
Why should I come?

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.040
Hello. They are not my family,
they're Nilofer's family.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.370
They invited me.
And I'm inviting you.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.630
Get lost.
I have a lot of work.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:37.480
Reena.. Please, Reena..
Think about it, please.

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:38.540
Hello.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.210
Log this properly.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:52.400
I think it didn't work out.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.840
What?
- I asked if your plan failed.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.420
What plan?

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:02.370
You changed Reena's file
and tried to create problems.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.390
Radhi called Reena and scolded her.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:07.600
But they are casual now.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:09.540
I don't think there is a problem.

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:13.670
Sir, how are you so sure
that I did it?

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:19.070
We planned to create
problems between them.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.000
I didn't do it.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:22.500
So, obviously it's you.

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:26.970
I wouldn't have changed
the file to create problems.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.460
Don't blame me.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.150
You didn't change the file?

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:32.200
No.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:38.150
There is someone else in
this hospital who thinks like us.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:40.230
Who is it?

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:42.620
Arjun.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:47.610
Hi, Manasa.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:49.730
Hi.
- How is your work?

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:51.230
It's going well.

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.230
Are you free tomorrow evening?

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:57.790
Why?
- Shall we go for dinner?

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.510
No, Manasa.
I have some work.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:04.880
Is it?

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:06.620
But why all of a sudden?

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:09.070
It's my birthday tomorrow.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:12.200
I don't know with
whom I can celebrate.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:13.460
That's why I asked you.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.330
It's okay, leave it.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:17.930
Manasa, one minute.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:21.930
Let's go.

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:23.290
Are you sure?

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:25.530
Yeah, sure.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.040
Superb.

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:30.380
Shall we leave together
from the hospital tomorrow?

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:32.250
Okay.

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:33.920
Okay, bye.

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:44.830
Dad.

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.040
How are you, Divi?

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:54.320
I'm fine, Dad.

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:57.380
Why aren't you
coming home these days?

00:05:58.310 --> 00:05:59.580
I have some work.

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:02.080
You can come home
and do that work.

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.630
Divi, you understand everything.

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:06.340
So, don't ask like
you don't understand.

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:08.920
Your mom and I
have decided to separate.

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:12.290
It's not my mom's wish.
It's your decision.

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:15.330
Yes, it's my decision.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:17.360
I can't stay here.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:19.430
Why, Dad?

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:23.820
Mom wants to talk to you.
Please listen to her.

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:26.470
It's beyond that, Divi.

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:30.080
You should talk to Sid
and make him understand. Okay?

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:33.170
I want to talk to you
about something.

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:34.790
Tell me.

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:38.650
Do you want to be
with your mom or me?

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:42.500
I can take you both
after fighting in the court.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:44.810
But your wish is important to me.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:48.960
We were so happy together.
We can be like that forever.

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:51.500
We don't have that option, Divi.

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:56.340
Mom will be alone.
What will she do?

00:06:59.130 --> 00:06:59.980
I understand.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:02.170
You don't have to tell me now.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:04.240
Think about it and let me know.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:08.260
Okay, I'll leave now.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.500
Wait till mom comes
and take Sid safely.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.210
Nurse, did you check the pressure?
- Yes, Doctor.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:24.630
You both go there.
- Okay.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.670
Oh, no.. Doctor, seizure.

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:43.130
Nurse, get me the injection
immediately. - Okay, Doctor.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.550
Doctor, her blood
pressure is increasing.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:48.490
Doctor, her heart rate is irregular.

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:50.150
Get the BP machine.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:52.650
Dehydration.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:55.660
Everyone.

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.350
Hey guys, listen to me.

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.250
Start the IV fluids immediately.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.570
Yes, sir.
- Okay, sir.

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:07.890
How are they?
- Who are you?

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:09.540
I'm their coach.

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:11.420
They are top athletes
at the state level.

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:12.420
What happened?

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:15.950
After breakfast, they were doing
warm-up exercises.

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:18.580
Then they started fainting
one by one.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:20.540
One of them vomited blood.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:23.330
I called the ambulance immediately.
- Vomited blood?

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.630
Yes, Doctor.
- What did they eat?

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:27.420
Food from the camp, Doctor.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:30.240
Everyone ate it. Even I ate it.
No one had any problem.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:33.960
From what we checked,
they are severely dehydrated.

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:35.200
We've started IV.

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:37.270
Some test results are expected.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:39.800
We'll keep you updated
as soon as they arrive. - Okay.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.540
Sir..

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:47.230
Sir, I tried to give IV.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:49.620
I couldn't.
The nerves are shrunk, sir.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:51.530
So I had to administer it
in the central vein.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:55.900
Kamal.
- Sir.

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:02.420
Is it necessary, sir?

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:03.480
Do what I say.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.820
Observe them till we get
the test results.

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:09.260
If there are any abnormal changes,
observe the vitals and inform me.

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:10.750
And bring Naveen.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.640
We'll have a meeting in the
conference room. - Okay, sir.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:13.960
Okay?
- Okay, sir.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:17.670
Sorry, guys. I'm a bit late.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.020
It's okay, sir.

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:23.080
Anu, Viji, Brinda.

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:26.890
Three exceptional athletes with
exceptional records and physique.

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:29.690
Three of them have been admitted
today. Initial observations.

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:32.910
Dehydration. High blood pressure.
Seizure. And..

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:35.430
Dilated pupils
and high heart rate, sir.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:36.380
Yes.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.370
Is it all for one person?
- No.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:40.920
Three of them have
the same symptoms.

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:44.540
Sir, it could be food poisoning.

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:46.880
All the others in the camp
ate the same food.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.540
But they are fine.

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:50.940
What if they had taken steroids?

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:53.060
Ma'am, there's a chance
of it being steroid poisoning.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:55.090
No..
Chances are very less.

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:57.000
They won't react so vigorously.

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:58.970
I believe..

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:00.810
They are drug abusers.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.290
That's why I've asked
Kamal to run a drug test.

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:08.690
So you've decided it, sir.
Then, why are we meeting now?

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:10.960
I need extra hands.

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:13.780
That's why I wanted
everyone to know these details.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.880
Okay.
- I'll handle two patients.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:18.670
It's enough if you handle one.

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:19.970
Okay?

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:21.710
Fine, sir.

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:35.370
Hey, Guna!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.670
You could've taken
some more rest, right?

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:42.120
I miss my mom when I'm home.

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:46.010
That's why I came
to work as a way distraction.

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:47.420
Where is everyone?

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:49.620
Rocky, Reena, Naveen?

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:54.680
Everyone is in the conference
room to discuss a case.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:57.380
What case?

00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:59.390
How would I know?

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.040
Okay.
Leave that.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:06.960
How are you?
Are you okay?

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:09.670
I'm fine.

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:13.130
Okay.

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:15.290
Why aren't you coming to our house?

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:17.550
I don't feel like it.

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:21.250
I feel.. lost.

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:24.500
Okay.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.290
Will you come today?

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:28.920
We'll see.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.650
Don't think that you
don't have anyone here.

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:43.430
We're all here for you.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:45.710
Even if you
don't have anyone else..

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:47.690
I'm here for you, okay?

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:49.760
What are you doing?

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:51.580
Someone might see us.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:54.340
I don't mind.
Let anyone see us.

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:56.870
Senior!

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:57.830
Nurse!

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:04.250
What?

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.910
You said you didn't care.

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:11.290
I did say I don't care..

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:18.360
Arjun, tell me what it is.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:20.840
There's a new case. Dr. Radhi has
asked me to look at it, I've to go.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:26.170
I'm going out for dinner tomorrow.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.210
Is that why you called me?

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:29.630
Okay, go.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:34.160
With Manasa.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:39.110
Oh!

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:43.140
You two are having coffee together.

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:44.810
Dinner is not a big deal.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:46.170
Go ahead.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:49.290
What's this all of a sudden?

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:53.090
It's her birthday tomorrow.

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:54.590
That's why she invited me.

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.050
So..

00:12:57.110 --> 00:12:59.170
Birthday celebration with dinner.

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:00.710
It's not like that.

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:02.670
She said she didn't know
whom to go out with.

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:04.290
That's why.
- Oh!

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:05.980
She doesn't have any friends, right?

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:07.790
She only invited you.

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:10.390
I don't know if she
has friends or not.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.080
But I know she doesn't
have anyone in the hospital.

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:14.170
So, she said that?

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:16.630
Then why did she invite me?

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:18.910
Okay, go.

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:21.670
Why are you telling me this?

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:25.530
You'd want to know, right?

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:28.170
I want to know..

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:30.840
Kiran, what kind
of food do you like?

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:33.130
I like all kinds of food.

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:35.260
That's what I'm asking.
Is it veg or non-veg?

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:37.560
I don't care about all that.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:38.790
I eat whatever they give me.

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:40.270
Be specific.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:43.000
If it's non-veg,
I like prawns a lot.

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:44.960
If it's veg, I like beetroot
and bitter gourd a lot.

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:45.860
Something like that.

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:47.430
Beetroot and bitter gourd?
- Yes.

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:49.300
You must like
something like that, right?

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:50.660
I said I like food.

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:52.630
Don't torture me
by asking silly questions.

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:54.280
Hey!

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:57.710
Why are you talking as if you
don't want to come to dinner?

00:13:57.880 --> 00:13:59.080
You know I'm not interested.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:00.630
And yet you torture me
with these questions.

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:03.030
Who tortured you?

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:04.870
You agreed to come, right?
- Yes.

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:07.590
Otherwise, your father will
come here. That's why I said yes.

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:11.310
You don't have to force yourself.

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:15.000
Oh, okay, I won't come.

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:20.060
Kiran!
Come.

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:21.210
Me?

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:27.920
Arjun!
I forgot to tell you something.

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:29.360
What is it?
Tell me.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.020
Kiran, you invited me
for dinner, right? - Yes.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:34.350
I'll come.
- Really?

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.290
He invited me
just like how Manasa invited you.

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.040
To have fun.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:42.560
You should know that.

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:46.380
Reena!
Will you really come?

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:47.820
I'll definitely come, Kiran.

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:50.220
Yes.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:54.000
Super, Reena.
Thank you. Bye.

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:55.330
Wow..

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.460
Nilofer.
- What?

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:04.410
I'll come to the dinner.
- No need.

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:06.930
Nilofer, please, I'll come.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.540
Hey, you just said
that you won't come.

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:10.420
What is it now?

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:11.960
Reena is coming.

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.000
That's why.

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:16.040
Who invited her?
- I did.

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.380
I need company, right?

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:20.550
Kiran!
That's a family dinner.

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:22.090
Why would she come?
- Hey!

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:25.070
I'm not your family.
Am I not coming? That's how it is.

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:28.130
Please, Nilofer.
Please.

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:32.160
Okay, come.

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:34.400
Wow.

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:41.510
This doesn't feel
like a planned dinner.

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:45.470
It feels like you said yes
after hearing what I said.

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:47.680
When did Manasa invite you?

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:49.470
I didn't check the time.

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:52.020
Kiran invited me as soon
as I entered this morning.

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:56.040
What is it now?

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:57.560
Nothing.

00:15:58.380 --> 00:15:59.380
Are you okay?

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:01.250
Yes.

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:08.110
Look here.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.930
You should pay the interest
without fail.

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.170
Come this way.

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:12.590
Dad, what happened?

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:14.660
There's someone there.
We shouldn't let him see us.

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:15.630
Let's go this way.

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:18.590
Dad, our house is on this side.
It's very close. - Listen to me.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:19.520
Let's go.

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:20.380
Otherwise..

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:22.400
Elango.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:25.380
You stay here.
I'll go and talk to him. - Okay.

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:27.760
Elango.
- Dad, what is it?

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:29.420
I'm talking to you.
- I told you to stop.

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:32.660
You're running away with the money
I gave you. I told you to stop.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:34.880
I'll tell you.
- It was a mistake to give you money.

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:36.810
Come fast.
- Hey!

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:39.370
Can't you drive carefully?
- Dad..

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.500
I was careful, it's your fault.

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:43.820
Dad!

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:45.780
It hurts, Dad.

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:51.920
How long will you keep running
away from the creditors?

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:53.320
Don't you have a solution?

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:56.110
You broke her leg now.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.860
She can't go to work in this
condition. How do we pay the debts?

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:01.090
How could I have known that
the creditor would be there?

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:04.630
This has become your routine.

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:06.400
Can you leave her alone?

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:09.860
You ask her to take leave and rest
when she is working.

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:12.900
Now you're complaining
that she can't go to work.

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:14.790
No, Abhi.
There is a lot of expenses.

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:17.930
The EB bill, grocery,
and a lot of EMI.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:19.870
I don't know
what I'm going to do now.

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:22.130
Mom! I know what you will say.

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.010
You're going to say

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:26.090
that it wouldn't have been a problem
if I had gone to work, right?

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:27.290
It's true, right?

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:29.460
If you had gone to work, there
wouldn't have been any problem.

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:31.000
Don't talk.

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:34.590
You drink and gamble.
And then you take loans too.

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:36.840
We should keep working
to pay off those loans.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:39.090
You keep saying this.

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:40.670
But one day

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:43.460
I'm going to win the gamble
and earn a lot.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:45.340
Our life will change upside down.

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:49.070
My life changed upside down
the day I wedded you.

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:51.170
And they are suffering
with us as their parents.

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:52.210
Keep quiet.

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:53.500
You're always blaming me.

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.880
Amaya dear, you tell me.

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:58.170
What should dad do?

00:17:58.410 --> 00:17:59.740
Shall I go work?

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.430
What have you done till now?

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:09.760
Should I list out what I have done?

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.750
You..
- All of you keep quiet.

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.600
Only my leg is injured, right?
Did I die?

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:24.790
Abhi.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:28.130
You go instead of me.

00:18:29.230 --> 00:18:30.920
Where?
- To the hospital.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.530
Hey, are you mad?

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:36.670
He will go to jail
for the work he does.

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:39.290
If I do what you say,
we should go to jail as a family.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.670
Abhi, look here.

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:44.180
You can't find a new job now.

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:46.490
I can't go for the job I have.

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:49.090
If I ask him,
he will get a loan from somewhere.

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:51.630
All of it will be a problem for us.

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:54.870
Why? If you don't go,
won't they pay you?

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:57.170
It's okay if it's
for a week or a month.

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.380
It will take three months to heal.

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:02.340
How can I believe that they
will pay me for three months?

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:07.040
Hey, what will I do there?

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:08.420
What do I know?

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:10.450
Hey, you pretend to be me.

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:12.220
No one will find out.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.050
If you get any work

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:17.190
ask Nurse Aruna or Dr. Kamal.

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.320
They will take care of it.

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:22.030
Try to understand, Abhi.

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:24.140
This is the only way we have.

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:27.430
Please, do this properly.

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:30.880
Amaya, she won't work.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:33.460
Is it easy to work?

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:34.500
Don't.

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:37.920
Abhi, please.

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:46.250
This family never trusted me.

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:50.180
But since I am
the only option for you now

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:53.250
okay, I will go.

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:57.640
Abhi dear,
I knew you would go to work.

00:19:57.990 --> 00:20:00.030
I was just teasing you.

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:03.810
Will you give me Rs. 500
when you get salary?

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.890
If I get caught,
I will mention your name first.

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:19.420
Where is Sid?

00:22:19.630 --> 00:22:22.030
Sid said he has to leave
early for practice,

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:23.130
so I dropped him.

00:22:23.330 --> 00:22:24.170
Oh!

00:22:27.490 --> 00:22:30.790
Divi, how is your hand now?

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:31.910
It's fine, Mom.

00:22:33.460 --> 00:22:36.740
If you want to talk about anything
or have any problem, tell me.

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:41.040
Elders always have some problems.

00:22:42.900 --> 00:22:43.780
Okay, eat.

00:22:47.200 --> 00:22:51.000
Mom, dad came to school yesterday.

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:53.540
Why?

00:22:53.660 --> 00:22:55.030
To talk to us.

00:22:55.090 --> 00:22:56.540
Sid was on the ground.

00:22:56.650 --> 00:22:58.670
So, he spoke to me and left.

00:22:58.920 --> 00:22:59.750
What did he say?

00:23:00.890 --> 00:23:04.840
He asked if we wanted
to be with you or with him.

00:23:05.700 --> 00:23:07.730
How can he ask you all this, Divi?

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:11.360
All this should be decided
in the court.

00:23:11.470 --> 00:23:13.210
There are many processes for that,
Divi.

00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:15.920
How can he decide all that?

00:23:17.200 --> 00:23:20.960
Okay, if dad talks to you again,
ask him to come home and talk.

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:22.610
Mom, he is my dad.

00:23:23.020 --> 00:23:25.010
He doesn't have to come home
and talk.

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:27.610
He can talk to you anywhere, Divi.

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:28.890
But not like this.

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:31.880
He will come to you and say

00:23:32.290 --> 00:23:36.290
I can't take care of you
and I don't care about you.

00:23:37.260 --> 00:23:39.920
Don't believe anything, Divi.
I will take care of everything.

00:23:41.260 --> 00:23:42.930
Why didn't you pick up the call
yesterday?

00:23:43.090 --> 00:23:47.210
The principal called to talk to you
about Reena coming to school.

00:23:47.410 --> 00:23:48.570
Why didn't you pick up the call?

00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:51.410
Dad didn't say anything
as you said.

00:23:51.570 --> 00:23:53.150
He didn't even talk about you.

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:57.240
He asked me to make Sid understand.

00:23:57.400 --> 00:23:59.790
Then he asked us to decide.
That's all.

00:24:01.050 --> 00:24:02.650
What did you say for that?

00:24:20.840 --> 00:24:22.290
I didn't say anything.

00:24:36.380 --> 00:24:37.600
Sir, the reports have come.

00:24:37.690 --> 00:24:39.530
All three of them have taken drugs.

00:24:39.600 --> 00:24:41.440
It has happened
because of an overdose.

00:24:42.000 --> 00:24:43.720
They have taken cocaine.

00:24:44.870 --> 00:24:46.080
No, doctor.

00:24:46.720 --> 00:24:47.780
This is not possible.

00:24:48.890 --> 00:24:51.500
They don't have any financial
backing to afford all this, doctor.

00:24:51.910 --> 00:24:53.420
This is not possible.

00:24:54.640 --> 00:24:56.170
Maybe something went wrong
in the test.

00:24:56.270 --> 00:24:59.040
Please run the test once again
for my sake.

00:24:59.150 --> 00:25:02.040
Sir, I am telling you
what is in the reports.

00:25:05.350 --> 00:25:09.540
They have struggled a lot and have
grown up as state-level players.

00:25:09.810 --> 00:25:11.750
Now, they are studying
in a sports quota.

00:25:11.950 --> 00:25:14.850
They wouldn't take a wrong path
as they know the value of this.

00:25:14.950 --> 00:25:16.800
Sir, please try to understand
what I am saying.

00:25:16.970 --> 00:25:19.590
Had they ingested an extra
milligram, they would have died.

00:25:20.330 --> 00:25:22.850
Maybe, they might have done
this for the reason that you said.

00:25:23.460 --> 00:25:25.500
They might have done this to win,
right?

00:25:27.940 --> 00:25:28.820
No, doctor.

00:25:29.540 --> 00:25:30.640
They are my students.

00:25:31.180 --> 00:25:33.410
I won't believe if you say
that they have done this.

00:25:34.640 --> 00:25:36.120
Something else has gone wrong
in this.

00:25:39.410 --> 00:25:40.310
Excuse me, ma'am.

00:25:41.130 --> 00:25:43.300
Ma'am, the reports of those
three athletes have come.

00:25:45.040 --> 00:25:46.790
Drug overdose, ma'am.
Cocaine.

00:25:48.830 --> 00:25:50.750
It is illegal to use this.

00:25:50.990 --> 00:25:53.830
Moreover, athletes using this
is a serious offence.

00:25:54.990 --> 00:25:58.000
But, ma'am, the coach is saying
that they wouldn't have taken it.

00:25:58.310 --> 00:25:59.690
This is a serious offence, Reena.

00:25:59.770 --> 00:26:00.920
They won't agree for sure.

00:26:02.110 --> 00:26:05.330
From what the coach said,
I didn't feel like that, ma'am.

00:26:05.910 --> 00:26:08.150
He is suspecting that something
else might have happened.

00:26:10.210 --> 00:26:13.350
Only if someone
regains consciousness,

00:26:13.420 --> 00:26:14.680
we will get an answer for this.

00:26:15.640 --> 00:26:18.200
Reena, this is a sensitive case.
Handle it carefully.

00:26:18.410 --> 00:26:19.220
Yes, ma'am.

00:26:19.410 --> 00:26:22.090
And, you are giving IV fluids
to them, right?

00:26:22.210 --> 00:26:24.730
Add benzodiazepine to it.

00:26:24.880 --> 00:26:27.420
I will come and check the vitals.
And, aspirin...

00:26:28.600 --> 00:26:30.690
No, no need to give aspirin.
This is enough.

00:26:30.810 --> 00:26:31.620
Okay, ma'am.

00:26:31.830 --> 00:26:34.050
I will inform Mr. Preetham
and proceed, right?

00:26:34.230 --> 00:26:36.460
No, there is no time for that.
You start it soon.

00:26:36.630 --> 00:26:38.190
It is just a preliminary.
It's okay.

00:26:38.570 --> 00:26:39.960
Okay, ma'am.
Thank you.

00:26:52.440 --> 00:26:53.420
Hi, Teju.

00:26:54.310 --> 00:26:55.320
What are you doing here?

00:26:56.820 --> 00:27:00.530
Got the results of those athletes.
Did you report it to Mr. Preetham?

00:27:00.860 --> 00:27:02.290
He hasn't come yet.

00:27:02.920 --> 00:27:03.940
Then, call him.

00:27:04.860 --> 00:27:06.090
He won't answer my calls.

00:27:11.310 --> 00:27:12.250
I have a doubt.

00:27:13.500 --> 00:27:15.730
I checked your sister's profile.

00:27:16.150 --> 00:27:17.030
Wait.

00:27:17.570 --> 00:27:19.830
Your sister's profile didn't say
she has siblings.

00:27:20.140 --> 00:27:21.020
That's okay.

00:27:21.520 --> 00:27:25.920
But, your parents' names and
her parents' names are different.

00:27:27.060 --> 00:27:29.010
I don't understand your story.

00:27:30.080 --> 00:27:34.040
No one can access
a worker's profile.

00:27:34.260 --> 00:27:35.220
How did you see it?

00:27:35.640 --> 00:27:37.580
I somehow saw it.
You tell me.

00:27:41.400 --> 00:27:45.380
Actually, Manasa
and I are siblings by birth.

00:27:47.960 --> 00:27:51.320
My dad gave Manasa to his sister
when she was born

00:27:51.500 --> 00:27:52.640
as she didn't have a child.

00:27:53.060 --> 00:27:54.710
Oh, my God!

00:27:57.030 --> 00:27:59.000
Is your dad a saint?

00:27:59.860 --> 00:28:02.290
He donated this place to RK sir.

00:28:02.450 --> 00:28:05.130
He gave his own child
to his sister.

00:28:05.490 --> 00:28:08.510
If someone else had asked for
a child, would he have given you?

00:28:08.600 --> 00:28:09.420
Hey, Teju.

00:28:09.500 --> 00:28:11.130
Then, what?
Your family is like that.

00:28:11.580 --> 00:28:15.630
Whatever he refused,
it has become a problem now.

00:28:16.120 --> 00:28:17.440
I have also been saying...

00:28:17.950 --> 00:28:20.130
I am trying to stop her
and send her from here.

00:28:21.160 --> 00:28:22.820
But, nothing seems to be happening.

00:28:23.020 --> 00:28:25.830
Hey, I am trying from my side.

00:28:26.980 --> 00:28:29.380
You are threatening me.
She is threatening me from there.

00:28:29.480 --> 00:28:32.300
I don't know what to do
by getting caught between you.

00:28:36.480 --> 00:28:37.660
Okay.

00:28:38.280 --> 00:28:39.460
So much is happening here.

00:28:39.930 --> 00:28:41.020
What is your brother doing?

00:28:41.120 --> 00:28:42.020
What does he care?

00:28:42.950 --> 00:28:45.470
He would be sitting at home
and watching what's happening here.

00:28:46.680 --> 00:28:48.880
My sister-in-law told me
that he is looking for a job.

00:28:51.770 --> 00:28:54.040
All of you are changing
all of a sudden.

00:28:57.850 --> 00:28:58.660
Teju.

00:28:59.710 --> 00:29:00.770
Do you know something?

00:29:01.250 --> 00:29:02.150
What is it?

00:29:02.340 --> 00:29:04.170
Today is Manasa's birthday.

00:29:05.870 --> 00:29:07.560
Shall we split and buy a cake
and cut it?

00:29:08.410 --> 00:29:09.590
Are you asking for real?

00:29:10.470 --> 00:29:11.630
Look at his face.

00:29:14.490 --> 00:29:15.430
Hey, Guna.

00:29:17.690 --> 00:29:18.560
Come here.

00:29:23.710 --> 00:29:26.630
Why did you come so soon?
Is everything okay?

00:29:26.830 --> 00:29:27.650
Everything is okay.

00:29:31.060 --> 00:29:32.790
Buddy, I want to ask you something.

00:29:32.960 --> 00:29:34.030
Tell me..
- Naveen.

00:29:34.690 --> 00:29:37.020
I also wanted
to tell you something.

00:29:37.280 --> 00:29:38.100
Tell me.

00:29:40.050 --> 00:29:45.130
Someone in our hospital has been
secretly in love for a long time.

00:29:45.310 --> 00:29:46.120
Someone told me.

00:29:46.630 --> 00:29:47.670
Have you heard about it?

00:29:49.660 --> 00:29:52.720
Okay, leave it.
There is no time to talk about it.

00:29:52.910 --> 00:29:53.800
You tell me, buddy.

00:29:55.800 --> 00:29:57.370
Which range is that athlete's case?

00:29:57.440 --> 00:29:59.610
Dr. Naveen.
Mr. Preetham has come.

00:30:00.440 --> 00:30:02.090
I'll come. You go.
- Okay, doctor.

00:30:02.630 --> 00:30:03.690
He has come.

00:30:04.440 --> 00:30:06.290
Okay, I'll leave.

00:30:06.990 --> 00:30:08.290
Teju is in that case.

00:30:08.420 --> 00:30:09.750
Can you explain it to him?

00:30:11.880 --> 00:30:14.170
Okay, I'll come.
See you. Bye, Teju.

00:30:16.380 --> 00:30:18.250
You came to ask about Naveen,
right?

00:30:19.230 --> 00:30:20.040
No.

00:30:20.160 --> 00:30:22.920
I told you not to ask Naveen
when I said that.

00:30:24.150 --> 00:30:26.420
There are already a lot
of problems in the hospital.

00:30:26.940 --> 00:30:27.760
Be patient.

00:30:28.360 --> 00:30:30.210
I am telling you for the good
of the hospital.

00:30:30.840 --> 00:30:33.550
You are telling me
for the good of the hospital.

00:30:33.680 --> 00:30:37.250
Hey, I am doing it for the good
of the hospital from the beginning.

00:30:37.810 --> 00:30:39.700
You all didn't listen.
What can I do?

00:30:41.590 --> 00:30:42.500
Okay.

00:30:42.990 --> 00:30:45.630
What is happening between you
and that senior?

00:30:50.620 --> 00:30:53.340
I think those in love
are not happy at all.

00:30:57.800 --> 00:30:58.620
Yuck!

00:30:59.570 --> 00:31:00.700
It's not good at all.

00:31:01.320 --> 00:31:03.380
How does Amaya come
to work daily in this look?

00:31:06.490 --> 00:31:08.220
Shall I give IV injections
or tablet?

00:31:08.320 --> 00:31:09.760
We have already given
the injection.

00:31:10.230 --> 00:31:12.380
This guy's name
is some actor's name.

00:31:13.930 --> 00:31:14.750
Rajini!

00:31:14.880 --> 00:31:16.630
Okay, check.
- Okay, doctor.

00:31:20.840 --> 00:31:22.840
Ramarajan!
- I'll give this report..

00:31:23.140 --> 00:31:24.200
That's also not his name!

00:31:24.560 --> 00:31:25.880
Some other name will come.

00:31:27.120 --> 00:31:27.980
Kamal!

00:31:28.840 --> 00:31:29.680
This is okay.

00:31:29.780 --> 00:31:30.700
Which patient, doctor?

00:31:32.140 --> 00:31:32.960
Dey!

00:31:34.790 --> 00:31:36.330
You check. I'll come.
- Okay, doctor.

00:31:38.440 --> 00:31:39.420
Hi, Kamal!

00:31:40.180 --> 00:31:41.890
Did you call me 'Dey'?
- No.

00:31:42.160 --> 00:31:43.340
I said hi, Kamal.

00:31:43.950 --> 00:31:45.670
Did you call 'Dey' before hi?

00:31:46.050 --> 00:31:47.360
I didn't call that.

00:31:48.790 --> 00:31:49.590
Okay, I'll come.

00:31:50.050 --> 00:31:52.040
Wait!
I came to talk to you.

00:31:55.400 --> 00:31:57.960
I think you expect to talk
as if nothing happened.

00:31:58.270 --> 00:31:59.090
What to do?

00:31:59.310 --> 00:32:00.660
I can't talk like that.

00:32:00.860 --> 00:32:02.250
I feel sad.

00:32:02.670 --> 00:32:04.340
Why?
What happened?

00:32:05.280 --> 00:32:06.380
What happened!

00:32:06.770 --> 00:32:07.690
Don't you know?

00:32:08.220 --> 00:32:09.750
You know, right?
Tell me.

00:32:09.840 --> 00:32:12.000
Yes, I'm telling.
First tell me, why did you call me?

00:32:12.630 --> 00:32:14.420
Preetham sir asked me to work
with you.

00:32:15.190 --> 00:32:16.600
This has become his job.

00:32:16.850 --> 00:32:20.880
He takes fun in teaming people
who are fighting each other.

00:32:21.330 --> 00:32:24.250
And he keeps on asking
if he's a good doctor.

00:32:24.770 --> 00:32:25.680
Fight?

00:32:26.200 --> 00:32:27.500
What is the problem between us?

00:32:27.930 --> 00:32:30.390
Don't start from the beginning.

00:32:30.620 --> 00:32:31.720
You want a job, right?

00:32:31.820 --> 00:32:34.280
There is a patient in the 10th bed.
Go and see him.

00:32:34.380 --> 00:32:35.280
Is that all?

00:32:35.360 --> 00:32:36.760
Is it enough to see?

00:32:36.920 --> 00:32:38.490
Is it enough to see!

00:32:39.310 --> 00:32:40.760
Go and do the job.

00:32:41.720 --> 00:32:43.830
What is that job?

00:32:44.460 --> 00:32:45.990
What job?

00:32:46.750 --> 00:32:48.130
Right.

00:32:48.380 --> 00:32:50.370
You seem to have decided.

00:32:50.490 --> 00:32:53.560
Please don't irritate me
in the morning.

00:32:53.670 --> 00:32:55.790
Okay.
I'll take care of it.

00:32:56.590 --> 00:32:57.390
Go.

00:32:58.910 --> 00:32:59.950
Amaya.

00:33:01.260 --> 00:33:02.300
Amaya.

00:33:02.890 --> 00:33:03.830
Amaya!

00:33:04.580 --> 00:33:07.530
It's me. I am Amaya.

00:33:07.610 --> 00:33:09.590
It's you.
Come here.

00:33:10.170 --> 00:33:10.970
Tell me the truth.

00:33:11.400 --> 00:33:12.670
You called me 'Dey', right?

00:33:13.000 --> 00:33:13.850
No.
Sir.

00:33:14.110 --> 00:33:17.210
You would have heard wrong.
I called 'Hey'.

00:33:17.610 --> 00:33:18.430
That's okay.

00:33:18.560 --> 00:33:19.780
You're a poor kid.

00:33:20.040 --> 00:33:22.590
My ear has gone bad, like my mind.

00:33:23.250 --> 00:33:25.430
Why are you standing here?
Go and do your work. Go.

00:33:26.980 --> 00:33:27.960
What's this, Kamal?

00:33:28.260 --> 00:33:29.560
You've become like this.

00:33:29.790 --> 00:33:30.910
Is this new?

00:33:30.980 --> 00:33:32.760
Everything will be fine.
Go and do your work.

00:33:34.460 --> 00:33:37.290
What's this?
You've prescribed benzodiazepine.

00:33:37.600 --> 00:33:39.090
How can you decide all this?

00:33:39.210 --> 00:33:41.590
Sir, the report says that
the girls have taken drugs.

00:33:41.650 --> 00:33:44.450
Of course, I can see that. But,
their nerves have shrunk a lot.

00:33:44.760 --> 00:33:48.090
What if they get a stroke
without of blood thinners?

00:33:48.280 --> 00:33:50.900
Sir, IV fluids are enough
for drug overdose.

00:33:51.350 --> 00:33:53.750
I've given another medication
for seizure.

00:33:53.880 --> 00:33:56.790
And, I felt it was wrong to give
aspirin.

00:33:57.650 --> 00:33:59.870
A girl has vomited blood.

00:33:59.980 --> 00:34:02.160
So, how can we give aspirin
without knowing

00:34:02.210 --> 00:34:03.540
if there's any internal bleeding?

00:34:03.940 --> 00:34:05.230
In other cases, it's okay.

00:34:05.780 --> 00:34:06.790
But, not here.

00:34:07.200 --> 00:34:08.400
I feel there's a risk.

00:34:08.580 --> 00:34:10.420
Will you take the blame
if something happens?

00:34:10.630 --> 00:34:13.110
How can you proceed
without consulting me

00:34:13.170 --> 00:34:14.500
in such a situation?

00:34:14.830 --> 00:34:16.450
Sir, we didn't have time then.

00:34:16.650 --> 00:34:18.510
And, nothing will happen
as you think.

00:34:18.640 --> 00:34:20.040
Everything is under control.

00:34:20.110 --> 00:34:22.900
If something happens, you have
to take the responsibility.

00:34:22.960 --> 00:34:23.860
Alright?

00:34:27.230 --> 00:34:28.590
Bloody unprofessional.

00:34:29.000 --> 00:34:30.420
Actually, madam..
He is..

00:34:30.490 --> 00:34:32.130
Hey, Kamal!
- Sir.

00:34:45.970 --> 00:34:47.490
'Is he alive?'

00:34:48.660 --> 00:34:50.090
Amaya, what are you doing?

00:34:50.260 --> 00:34:51.550
Can't you understand?

00:34:51.640 --> 00:34:53.080
No. That's why I asked.

00:34:53.810 --> 00:34:54.710
I'm observing.

00:34:54.780 --> 00:34:56.170
What are you observing?

00:34:57.370 --> 00:34:58.920
I'm doing something.
Why do you bother?

00:34:59.390 --> 00:35:01.170
Don't disturb me.
Go.

00:35:10.260 --> 00:35:12.580
Amaya.
Amaya.

00:35:12.950 --> 00:35:15.790
Doctor.
- What are you doing?

00:35:16.540 --> 00:35:17.710
I'm observing the patient.

00:35:18.360 --> 00:35:19.840
It's okay to observe the patient.

00:35:19.930 --> 00:35:21.810
I asked you to observe
the patient in the 10th bed.

00:35:21.860 --> 00:35:23.380
what are you doing in the 8th bed?

00:35:24.440 --> 00:35:25.400
10th bed?

00:35:25.530 --> 00:35:26.390
Yes.

00:35:27.070 --> 00:35:28.130
Okay.

00:35:28.780 --> 00:35:29.910
I'll go and observe.

00:35:31.630 --> 00:35:33.000
What happened to her?

00:35:41.840 --> 00:35:43.460
'Is he alive?'

00:35:44.880 --> 00:35:47.130
Why are you observing me?
Observe the patient.

00:35:51.360 --> 00:35:54.040
Amaya.
Check the vitals.

00:35:55.490 --> 00:35:57.090
'He's asking me things
I don't know.'

00:35:58.960 --> 00:36:01.340
Vitals?
How can I check it?

00:36:01.440 --> 00:36:02.260
Check my head.

00:36:04.290 --> 00:36:06.040
What happened to you today?

00:36:06.400 --> 00:36:07.960
Why are you spaced out?

00:36:08.150 --> 00:36:10.000
Kamal.
I don't know what it is.

00:36:10.400 --> 00:36:12.630
I'm forgetful.
- Okay.

00:36:12.740 --> 00:36:15.810
Suddenly,
I don't remember anything.

00:36:16.300 --> 00:36:17.960
This is a good story.

00:36:18.250 --> 00:36:21.300
Forgetting ID card and watch
can be considered forgetful.

00:36:21.390 --> 00:36:23.710
You forgot to check vitals.
What can we do?

00:36:23.850 --> 00:36:26.540
I've never heard
of such a thing in medical history.

00:36:26.830 --> 00:36:29.290
Why?
Did you bunk the class that day?

00:36:29.600 --> 00:36:32.880
Or is it a new disease?

00:36:33.350 --> 00:36:34.270
Amaya.

00:36:34.660 --> 00:36:37.790
Mr. Preetham
is already irritating me.

00:36:38.350 --> 00:36:41.510
Please control your sense
of humour and do your work.

00:36:41.620 --> 00:36:43.130
You too don't irritate me.

00:36:43.390 --> 00:36:44.330
Please, Amaya.

00:36:44.490 --> 00:36:46.300
He's...
- You're done for.

00:36:47.310 --> 00:36:49.290
'What am I going to do?'

00:36:50.360 --> 00:36:51.370
'Amaya.'

00:36:57.860 --> 00:36:59.790
Hey!
Aren't you Aruna?

00:37:00.130 --> 00:37:01.840
What?

00:37:02.810 --> 00:37:04.300
Give me the file.

00:37:10.680 --> 00:37:13.290
Hi.
- Hi.

00:37:15.410 --> 00:37:18.290
Hi.
- Hi.

00:37:21.020 --> 00:37:23.420
Hi.
- What do you want?

00:37:24.910 --> 00:37:27.380
I don't know what it is.

00:37:27.460 --> 00:37:30.430
My hands are shivering
since morning.

00:37:30.670 --> 00:37:32.500
I can't even write properly.

00:37:34.020 --> 00:37:35.840
Can you do me a favour?

00:37:36.130 --> 00:37:39.100
I need to update the vitals
in the file.

00:37:39.210 --> 00:37:40.630
Can you update it for me?

00:37:41.130 --> 00:37:42.860
Why didn't you tell me this
earlier?

00:37:42.930 --> 00:37:44.290
Is this why you're so excited?

00:37:44.950 --> 00:37:46.250
'Oh, God!'

00:37:47.130 --> 00:37:48.380
Thanks, Aruna.

00:37:54.200 --> 00:37:58.340
Mom, I'm tired.
When can we go home?

00:37:58.460 --> 00:38:01.150
Divi, there's some work.
We can go once it's done.

00:38:01.220 --> 00:38:03.130
I'm very tired.

00:38:04.780 --> 00:38:06.100
Is there a lot of homework?

00:38:06.470 --> 00:38:08.520
You're saying this because
you don't want to do it. Isn't it?

00:38:08.590 --> 00:38:09.700
It's not like that.

00:38:09.880 --> 00:38:13.920
All the teachers took tests
and troubled us.

00:38:13.990 --> 00:38:19.040
And the PT teacher made us run
as a punishment for being late.

00:38:19.210 --> 00:38:20.030
Okay.

00:38:20.160 --> 00:38:21.670
Why are you laughing?

00:38:22.160 --> 00:38:24.240
Okay. Sorry.
Tell me.

00:38:24.440 --> 00:38:26.290
Am I narrating a story?

00:38:28.050 --> 00:38:30.090
Okay.
Are you tired because of that?

00:38:30.190 --> 00:38:31.050
Yes.

00:38:32.860 --> 00:38:33.940
Excuse me, ma'am.

00:38:35.780 --> 00:38:38.590
Ma'am, Teju asked me to give you
these OP files.

00:38:39.690 --> 00:38:41.420
Okay, ma'am.
I'm leaving.

00:38:42.040 --> 00:38:44.080
Mom, there's still
some pending homework.

00:38:44.220 --> 00:38:48.120
Not only that, my books are at home.
I'm very hungry.

00:38:48.250 --> 00:38:49.920
When can we go home?

00:38:50.460 --> 00:38:51.500
Let's go.

00:38:54.260 --> 00:38:56.630
Shall I take her..

00:38:57.900 --> 00:39:00.630
No.
- Is it wrong to help?

00:39:01.610 --> 00:39:03.180
I don't want your help.

00:39:03.440 --> 00:39:05.540
I'm asking because
your house is on the way.

00:39:05.650 --> 00:39:07.300
Hasn't she come with me?

00:39:07.440 --> 00:39:08.320
Yes.

00:39:08.500 --> 00:39:11.000
Didn't you take her
to the swimming pool once?

00:39:11.600 --> 00:39:14.630
Why? I took her to school too.
You forgot that. - Reena.

00:39:15.990 --> 00:39:16.800
Mom.

00:39:16.900 --> 00:39:19.170
I'll go home with Reena.

00:39:22.490 --> 00:39:26.450
Okay. You have to go
home directly. Okay?

00:39:26.530 --> 00:39:27.460
Okay.

00:39:27.910 --> 00:39:31.420
She says she's hungry.
What if we eat..

00:39:33.430 --> 00:39:36.090
Divi.
Call me when you reach home.

00:39:36.410 --> 00:39:37.510
So much trust.

00:39:37.740 --> 00:39:38.580
Yes.

00:39:39.560 --> 00:39:40.370
Come.

00:39:41.960 --> 00:39:43.240
Bye, Mom.

00:39:49.070 --> 00:39:50.050
Reena.

00:39:51.550 --> 00:39:52.530
Shall we go?

00:39:53.200 --> 00:39:54.770
Where to?
- Where?

00:39:54.850 --> 00:39:56.080
You wanted to go for dinner.

00:39:56.610 --> 00:39:58.590
I forgot.

00:39:58.670 --> 00:40:00.710
It's okay.
I'm here to remind you.

00:40:01.540 --> 00:40:02.590
Shall we go?

00:40:05.640 --> 00:40:06.440
I'll come.

00:40:06.730 --> 00:40:08.950
Divi will also come.
Is it okay?

00:40:09.030 --> 00:40:10.740
You can bring anyone you want.

00:40:10.850 --> 00:40:12.130
We are not paying the bill.

00:40:14.790 --> 00:40:16.750
I'll get my keys.
- Okay.

00:40:19.680 --> 00:40:21.550
Why should we go for dinner
with him?

00:40:21.950 --> 00:40:24.340
Divi.
It'll be costly if we eat out.

00:40:24.630 --> 00:40:26.680
Someone is volunteering
to pay for us.

00:40:26.790 --> 00:40:29.420
Why should we miss it?
We can eat whatever we want.

00:40:30.600 --> 00:40:33.820
My mom is different,
and you are!

00:40:34.050 --> 00:40:36.630
I should have taken you home.
Come.

00:40:38.850 --> 00:40:39.950
Which table?

00:40:41.550 --> 00:40:42.530
There?

00:40:44.770 --> 00:40:45.940
Thank you.

00:40:57.900 --> 00:40:59.220
Thank you.
- Hey, Arjun.

00:41:00.440 --> 00:41:01.600
Wow.

00:41:04.440 --> 00:41:05.600
Thanks, Arjun.

00:41:05.710 --> 00:41:09.090
I didn't expect you to surprise me
with a cake.

00:41:13.100 --> 00:41:14.780
Thank you so much, Arjun.

00:41:14.920 --> 00:41:16.880
I love cakes.

00:41:20.590 --> 00:41:21.730
What is it, Arjun?

00:41:22.120 --> 00:41:23.560
You look upset.

00:41:24.400 --> 00:41:25.210
No..

00:41:25.280 --> 00:41:27.780
I know you didn't order a cake.

00:41:27.880 --> 00:41:29.110
I ordered it.

00:41:30.450 --> 00:41:31.740
Why would you do that?

00:41:32.420 --> 00:41:35.790
I love cutting cakes
and celebrating.

00:41:35.890 --> 00:41:36.720
Oh.

00:41:39.250 --> 00:41:40.490
I'm sorry, Manasa.

00:41:41.250 --> 00:41:44.090
I knew I should have brought a cake

00:41:44.860 --> 00:41:46.960
when they got it.

00:41:48.150 --> 00:41:49.240
It's okay.

00:41:49.820 --> 00:41:53.250
I'm happy that you came
for dinner with me.

00:41:54.610 --> 00:41:56.540
Okay.
Let's do one thing.

00:41:56.750 --> 00:41:59.000
Your birthday, my treat.

00:41:59.280 --> 00:42:00.460
The dinner is on me.

00:42:01.240 --> 00:42:03.680
No.
I brought you here.

00:42:03.820 --> 00:42:05.410
So I'll handle it.

00:42:05.730 --> 00:42:07.130
Don't say anything.

00:42:07.980 --> 00:42:09.130
I insist.

00:42:11.900 --> 00:42:12.840
Okay.

00:42:13.760 --> 00:42:14.830
Shall we cut?

00:42:14.890 --> 00:42:16.840
Hi.
Who is she?

00:42:17.170 --> 00:42:18.010
This is Divi.

00:42:18.240 --> 00:42:19.550
Hi, Divi.
- Hi.

00:42:20.140 --> 00:42:21.130
Careful.

00:42:21.560 --> 00:42:23.940
Many more happy returns of the day.
- Thank you.

00:42:24.440 --> 00:42:25.640
Happy birthday, Nilofer.

00:42:25.870 --> 00:42:27.130
Didn't you bring a knife?

00:42:27.210 --> 00:42:28.390
Hold on.
- Waiter.

00:42:28.440 --> 00:42:31.500
Is it your birthday?
- What would you have done?

00:42:31.980 --> 00:42:33.540
I would've wished you.

00:42:34.840 --> 00:42:36.290
Happy birthday.
- Thank you.

00:42:36.380 --> 00:42:39.020
You could've told.
- Let it be.

00:42:39.090 --> 00:42:40.170
Let's celebrate.

00:42:40.700 --> 00:42:42.910
I was wrong, Divi.
We are not eating free food.

00:42:42.970 --> 00:42:44.750
It's Nilofer's treat.

00:42:45.980 --> 00:42:47.960
Come.
- Come.

00:43:26.780 --> 00:43:27.700
Anu.

00:43:28.930 --> 00:43:29.840
Anu.

00:43:34.450 --> 00:43:35.960
Call Dr. Radhi.

00:44:41.739 --> 00:44:44.649
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:44:46.769 --> 00:44:49.399
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:44:51.859 --> 00:44:54.979
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:44:56.669 --> 00:44:58.939
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:44:59.269 --> 00:45:01.579
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:45:01.909 --> 00:45:04.429
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:45:04.619 --> 00:45:07.179
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:45:09.349 --> 00:45:12.099
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:45:14.349 --> 00:45:17.099
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:45:18.989 --> 00:45:23.169
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:45:38.589 --> 00:45:39.449
Wow.

00:45:40.099 --> 00:45:42.059
Your face has changed
in a short time.

00:45:42.899 --> 00:45:44.819
I should have taken a photo of it.

00:45:45.679 --> 00:45:46.599
You too?

00:45:47.529 --> 00:45:49.129
Why are you so scared?

00:45:49.579 --> 00:45:52.209
You got so excited thinking
that I brought the cake.

00:45:52.799 --> 00:45:55.379
I couldn't bring myself
to disappoint you.

00:45:56.479 --> 00:45:58.809
Being a CEO at such a young age

00:45:59.199 --> 00:46:00.479
how could you talk like this?

00:46:02.819 --> 00:46:03.729
By the way

00:46:04.929 --> 00:46:07.169
what were you doing
before becoming a CEO?

00:46:08.759 --> 00:46:10.559
I studied MBBS.

00:46:10.959 --> 00:46:11.849
Wow.

00:46:12.149 --> 00:46:13.679
You are also a doctor?

00:46:14.479 --> 00:46:15.339
Drop out.

00:46:15.629 --> 00:46:16.479
Why?

00:46:21.539 --> 00:46:22.599
My anger towards my dad.

00:46:25.099 --> 00:46:27.919
After knowing that
he was not at fault

00:46:28.199 --> 00:46:29.809
that anger turned into guilt.

00:46:31.839 --> 00:46:35.049
Before I could spend
the rest of my time with him..

00:46:38.879 --> 00:46:40.019
He passed away.

00:46:42.149 --> 00:46:43.349
I am sorry, Arjun.

00:46:45.229 --> 00:46:48.669
If you see it from outside,
I may seem rich and funny.

00:46:49.249 --> 00:46:50.459
But that's not the truth.

00:46:50.809 --> 00:46:51.849
It's very difficult.

00:46:52.729 --> 00:46:56.769
But every time I think how
my dad handled so many things

00:46:57.229 --> 00:46:58.469
I find it very surprising.

00:47:03.399 --> 00:47:07.539
Your dad would have gone
through all these situations.

00:47:07.839 --> 00:47:08.739
See, Arjun.

00:47:08.929 --> 00:47:10.289
This is like a test.

00:47:10.779 --> 00:47:14.149
It doesn't matter whether
your decision is right or wrong

00:47:15.159 --> 00:47:17.289
but it will make you a better CEO.

00:47:20.349 --> 00:47:21.349
You are right, Manasa.

00:47:24.469 --> 00:47:25.669
But I always wonder

00:47:26.019 --> 00:47:29.379
if anyone would stay by my side
and guide me.

00:47:30.399 --> 00:47:35.639
You are running such a big hospital
without any guidance so far.

00:47:36.549 --> 00:47:39.329
I think you can handle this.

00:47:39.519 --> 00:47:40.919
You can do it, Arjun.

00:47:52.269 --> 00:47:54.439
Divi, you can do it.
Eat well.

00:47:55.899 --> 00:47:57.849
My mom cooks well at home.

00:47:59.669 --> 00:48:02.829
Who said otherwise?
This is also good. Eat.

00:48:07.019 --> 00:48:08.099
Your name is Reena, right?

00:48:08.849 --> 00:48:09.679
Yes, sir.

00:48:09.949 --> 00:48:11.729
How is Kiran doing at work?

00:48:12.709 --> 00:48:14.399
Kiran?
- Our Kiran.

00:48:15.229 --> 00:48:17.269
Sir, he is not responsible at all.

00:48:17.399 --> 00:48:19.059
He keeps talking.

00:48:19.159 --> 00:48:22.849
He either talks to the nurses
or Nilofer or he talks to me.

00:48:23.529 --> 00:48:24.609
Not only that.

00:48:24.989 --> 00:48:27.759
He asks me out for coffee.
Now he has asked me out for dinner.

00:48:27.819 --> 00:48:29.979
He is always
doing something like this.

00:48:31.099 --> 00:48:33.459
Reena, wait..
- Wait, Nilofer.

00:48:33.539 --> 00:48:35.099
I have to tell them
what they want to know.

00:48:35.599 --> 00:48:38.259
He tortures Nilofer so much.

00:48:38.409 --> 00:48:40.459
He asks her to look
after the work given to him.

00:48:40.549 --> 00:48:42.989
She is a poor thing.
She does his work also.

00:48:43.599 --> 00:48:45.189
He has never made me do
anything like that.

00:48:45.259 --> 00:48:46.679
Look at her.

00:48:46.799 --> 00:48:48.299
She is always supporting him.

00:48:48.639 --> 00:48:51.789
The atrocities they
both commit together, oh, God..

00:48:52.759 --> 00:48:53.639
Reena.

00:48:53.859 --> 00:48:55.939
They are not
Dr. Preetham or Dr. Radhi.

00:48:56.309 --> 00:48:57.909
Why are you reporting like this?

00:48:58.359 --> 00:48:59.769
You can say something good, right?

00:48:59.899 --> 00:49:01.379
Hey, Reena.

00:49:01.689 --> 00:49:02.609
This is superb.

00:49:02.989 --> 00:49:04.279
Say something more like this.

00:49:06.159 --> 00:49:07.009
Sir.

00:49:07.529 --> 00:49:09.099
This is a work-related problem.

00:49:09.159 --> 00:49:11.479
But Kiran is a very good boy, sir.

00:49:12.949 --> 00:49:13.979
That's okay.

00:49:14.139 --> 00:49:15.349
Tell me about you.

00:49:17.389 --> 00:49:18.499
About me..

00:49:18.889 --> 00:49:20.709
How can I say it by myself?

00:49:20.859 --> 00:49:22.389
It will be good if others say it.

00:49:22.479 --> 00:49:23.629
I will tell you.

00:49:24.219 --> 00:49:26.559
Reena is a very friendly senior.

00:49:28.059 --> 00:49:30.729
But she is a bit strict.

00:49:31.399 --> 00:49:34.919
Not only that.
She is really short-tempered.

00:49:34.999 --> 00:49:36.229
She always scolds us.

00:49:37.309 --> 00:49:40.229
It's not like that.
Actually, Reena is very talented.

00:49:40.629 --> 00:49:42.559
There are many things
to learn from her.

00:49:42.629 --> 00:49:44.709
But she is very strict at work.

00:49:45.819 --> 00:49:46.729
Not only that.

00:49:46.869 --> 00:49:49.039
He is a small-time thug
and she is a big-time one.

00:49:49.139 --> 00:49:51.999
She has never been
to the hospital on time.

00:49:52.349 --> 00:49:55.289
And she gets scolded
most of the time.

00:49:55.449 --> 00:49:56.519
I have a doubt.

00:49:57.189 --> 00:49:58.919
How did you get promoted?

00:50:01.119 --> 00:50:04.259
Both of them are the same.
They are irresponsible.

00:50:09.559 --> 00:50:11.259
I was being irresponsible, Manasa.

00:50:12.729 --> 00:50:16.979
But they changed me slowly.
They made me feel better.

00:50:19.269 --> 00:50:21.729
Who are they?

00:50:23.559 --> 00:50:24.669
May I know?

00:50:26.579 --> 00:50:27.439
Kumar.

00:50:27.839 --> 00:50:28.689
My friends.

00:50:29.489 --> 00:50:30.309
And Reena.

00:50:33.849 --> 00:50:35.319
Is Reena your girlfriend?

00:50:37.479 --> 00:50:39.609
I don't know how
to explain my current situation.

00:50:41.139 --> 00:50:42.539
But I like her a lot.

00:50:44.709 --> 00:50:48.139
Many things in life
don't happen as we wish.

00:50:49.189 --> 00:50:52.169
But nothing happened to me
as per my wish.

00:50:53.059 --> 00:50:54.459
I like my mom a lot.

00:50:55.059 --> 00:50:56.539
I started liking my dad.

00:50:57.519 --> 00:50:58.619
I liked Reena.

00:51:00.439 --> 00:51:03.749
But I couldn't spend time
with them like I wanted.

00:51:04.639 --> 00:51:07.469
I didn't know why this was
happening or who was responsible.

00:51:09.959 --> 00:51:10.849
But it's me.

00:51:20.209 --> 00:51:23.619
I made them suffer a lot.

00:51:26.069 --> 00:51:27.759
I messed up their life.

00:51:32.529 --> 00:51:33.379
Arjun.

00:51:34.029 --> 00:51:34.949
Arjun.

00:51:37.889 --> 00:51:39.349
I know you are a good person.

00:51:41.899 --> 00:51:46.639
You felt bad that I couldn't attend
the interview and blamed yourself.

00:51:48.609 --> 00:51:51.059
You see everything in the same way.

00:51:51.529 --> 00:51:53.399
You should understand
that it's not like that.

00:51:53.849 --> 00:51:55.399
It's okay, we can handle it.

00:51:56.449 --> 00:51:59.579
It's been a long time
since I opened up like this.

00:52:03.639 --> 00:52:05.249
I feel so light.

00:52:06.599 --> 00:52:08.459
You can share anything
with me, Arjun.

00:52:09.009 --> 00:52:11.629
If you want me to be a therapist,
I will be a therapist.

00:52:11.929 --> 00:52:14.169
If you want me to be a friend,
I will be a friend.

00:52:15.979 --> 00:52:16.839
Thank you.

00:52:24.139 --> 00:52:25.019
Thanks, sir.

00:52:25.509 --> 00:52:26.389
For what?

00:52:26.559 --> 00:52:27.519
For the dinner.

00:52:28.329 --> 00:52:29.719
It wasn't like a treat.

00:52:30.239 --> 00:52:31.879
It was fun like a party.

00:52:33.959 --> 00:52:37.359
You said a lot about Kiran.

00:52:37.949 --> 00:52:39.899
How is Kiran personally?

00:52:39.949 --> 00:52:43.099
I said it to irritate them.

00:52:43.649 --> 00:52:45.889
I have known them
only for a few months.

00:52:46.129 --> 00:52:48.669
But I can say
that Kiran is a good person.

00:52:49.219 --> 00:52:52.329
Usually when we like someone,
we'd want to know about them.

00:52:52.659 --> 00:52:54.349
But when Kiran likes someone,

00:52:54.399 --> 00:52:56.349
he wants the other person
to know everything about him.

00:52:56.719 --> 00:52:57.889
Whether it's right or wrong.

00:52:58.039 --> 00:53:00.089
He will go to any extreme for them.

00:53:00.599 --> 00:53:02.849
He makes them feel special.

00:53:03.269 --> 00:53:06.249
He speaks his mind.
He helps everyone.

00:53:06.969 --> 00:53:09.749
He irritates the people he likes.

00:53:10.069 --> 00:53:12.029
But they'd still like him.

00:53:13.399 --> 00:53:15.919
You can say that
it is his love language.

00:53:16.629 --> 00:53:17.769
Just a minute.

00:53:18.249 --> 00:53:19.859
Okay.
- Tell me, Teju.

00:53:20.099 --> 00:53:23.039
'Reena, the three athletes
have regained consciousness.'

00:53:31.889 --> 00:53:33.489
What happened, Teju?
- I was just calling you.

00:53:33.939 --> 00:53:35.809
All three of them are conscious.

00:53:36.339 --> 00:53:37.839
But their vitals
are still abnormal.

00:53:38.479 --> 00:53:40.699
Their BP and heart rate
are not normal yet.

00:53:51.079 --> 00:53:52.639
Okay.
Did they say anything?

00:53:53.439 --> 00:53:54.349
No, ma'am.

00:53:59.519 --> 00:54:00.559
How are you now?

00:54:01.079 --> 00:54:01.979
Okay, ma'am.

00:54:11.019 --> 00:54:12.099
Did you take drugs?

00:54:20.559 --> 00:54:21.549
Yes, ma'am.

00:54:24.159 --> 00:54:27.909
I trained you based on your talent.

00:54:27.979 --> 00:54:29.589
But you wanted to take drugs.

00:54:30.159 --> 00:54:32.039
Aren't you ashamed
to do this as an athlete?

00:54:33.339 --> 00:54:35.419
I didn't expect this from you.

00:54:38.029 --> 00:54:39.929
You shouldn't have saved them.

00:54:42.129 --> 00:54:44.309
Nurse, take him out.

00:54:44.389 --> 00:54:45.349
Okay, Doctor.

00:54:46.029 --> 00:54:46.999
Come on, sir.

00:54:47.529 --> 00:54:50.379
You shouldn't have saved them..
- Sir, come with me..

00:54:53.579 --> 00:54:55.439
I told you that
nothing would happen.

00:54:56.479 --> 00:54:59.089
You were suspecting that
something would go wrong.

00:55:01.979 --> 00:55:03.649
Keep checking their vitals.

00:55:04.059 --> 00:55:06.749
Their BP will be fine.
But monitor their heart rate.

00:55:07.159 --> 00:55:07.989
Okay, ma'am.

00:55:17.309 --> 00:55:18.539
Sir.
- Doctor.

00:55:19.269 --> 00:55:21.039
As soon as they get better

00:55:21.449 --> 00:55:24.059
we have to file a police complaint.
- Doctor.

00:55:24.689 --> 00:55:26.039
Please don't do that.

00:55:27.249 --> 00:55:28.839
All three of them
are state-level players.

00:55:29.809 --> 00:55:31.209
If this news comes out

00:55:32.449 --> 00:55:33.879
it will be a big news.

00:55:34.299 --> 00:55:35.629
Their lives will be spoiled.

00:55:36.129 --> 00:55:37.019
I understand.

00:55:37.289 --> 00:55:39.339
But as per the protocols
of the hospital

00:55:39.449 --> 00:55:41.439
we have to do it.
We can't do anything else.

00:55:42.049 --> 00:55:44.659
Doctor, please reconsider.
If this news gets leaked

00:55:45.319 --> 00:55:47.479
they will lose
their sports quota seat.

00:55:48.929 --> 00:55:51.009
They can't study.

00:55:51.189 --> 00:55:52.799
They won't get a job.

00:55:53.919 --> 00:55:54.819
Please, Doctor.

00:55:55.479 --> 00:55:57.009
Their future will be spoiled.

00:55:58.859 --> 00:56:00.039
I will see what I can do.

00:56:16.589 --> 00:56:18.299
When did you diagnose this
as Lyme disease?

00:56:18.459 --> 00:56:20.169
I had gone to Chennai for work.

00:56:20.219 --> 00:56:23.519
I was not feeling well.
So I went to a nearby hospital.

00:56:23.639 --> 00:56:25.669
I was running a fever.
- I am sorry to interrupt.

00:56:25.849 --> 00:56:27.199
Which hospital in Chennai?

00:56:27.389 --> 00:56:28.499
RK Hospital, sir.

00:56:29.139 --> 00:56:30.589
RK Hospital, okay.

00:56:30.849 --> 00:56:32.139
They asked me to take a test.

00:56:32.239 --> 00:56:34.519
Then it was confirmed
as Lyme disease.

00:56:34.869 --> 00:56:37.139
Western blot test.
- That's the test.

00:56:37.209 --> 00:56:39.479
Why?
- Everything is correct.

00:56:39.529 --> 00:56:43.189
Usually no one can diagnose
this disease in its early stages.

00:56:43.269 --> 00:56:44.289
They'd be careless about it.

00:56:44.409 --> 00:56:47.439
Your doctor
has diagnosed it correctly.

00:56:47.489 --> 00:56:48.999
What did you say was
the name of the doctor?

00:56:49.439 --> 00:56:52.049
The doctor's name was..
- It's okay.

00:56:52.129 --> 00:56:53.199
If you don't know it, it's okay.

00:56:53.429 --> 00:56:55.689
Got it, sir.
It was Dr. Radhi.

00:56:57.689 --> 00:56:59.019
Radhi.
- Yes, sir.

00:57:00.309 --> 00:57:01.179
Is it?

00:57:02.439 --> 00:57:03.349
Okay.

00:57:04.229 --> 00:57:07.199
Come on time for your appointments.

00:57:07.309 --> 00:57:09.439
And take the medicines on time.

00:57:09.529 --> 00:57:10.799
Sure, sir.
- You can go.

00:57:11.119 --> 00:57:12.689
Thank you, sir.
- Thank you.

00:57:37.369 --> 00:57:38.939
Nurse, take care of her.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:57:47.889 --> 00:57:49.099
Hey, what are you doing?

00:57:50.309 --> 00:57:51.519
I just completed my rounds.

00:57:52.059 --> 00:57:53.789
Okay, let's go for a coffee.

00:57:54.269 --> 00:57:55.139
I have to work.

00:57:56.109 --> 00:57:57.589
You just said
you have completed your rounds.

00:57:58.589 --> 00:58:01.339
After this, I have to go to the ER
and then to the nurse station.

00:58:01.469 --> 00:58:02.309
I have work.

00:58:04.929 --> 00:58:05.849
Oh.

00:58:07.369 --> 00:58:11.479
Do you really have work or are
you just saying that to avoid me?

00:58:12.529 --> 00:58:13.869
Why should I avoid you?

00:58:13.959 --> 00:58:17.169
That's what I'm asking.
Why should you avoid me?

00:58:17.639 --> 00:58:20.289
Ever since you came back,
you don't talk to me.

00:58:22.189 --> 00:58:23.599
Don't you know why?

00:58:25.229 --> 00:58:28.409
Even after your mom died,
you were speaking to me well.

00:58:28.979 --> 00:58:30.139
What happened now?

00:58:31.889 --> 00:58:34.349
I'm telling you that
I'm in a bad state of mind.

00:58:35.049 --> 00:58:36.099
Won't you understand?

00:58:37.429 --> 00:58:40.709
Yes, you'll be in a good state
of mind when you talk to others.

00:58:40.899 --> 00:58:43.659
But when you talk to me, you'll
be in a bad state of mind, right?

00:58:46.959 --> 00:58:49.019
Everyone in this hospital
is rejecting me.

00:58:50.229 --> 00:58:51.749
Now you're also
rejecting me, right?

00:58:55.269 --> 00:58:56.269
Who's avoiding you?

00:58:56.909 --> 00:58:58.129
Who doesn't?

00:58:58.419 --> 00:59:00.539
Dr. Radhi has chosen Teju.

00:59:00.689 --> 00:59:02.809
Dr. Preetham has chosen
Naveen and Kamal.

00:59:03.409 --> 00:59:07.179
Arjun has chosen Reena over me
to assist Dr. Radhi.

00:59:09.639 --> 00:59:11.249
Now you're also doing the same.

00:59:13.509 --> 00:59:16.299
Hey, where am I in all this?

00:59:16.419 --> 00:59:17.769
It's only been a few days
since I came back.

00:59:18.139 --> 00:59:20.559
And you're dumping
all your problems on me.

00:59:21.189 --> 00:59:23.849
I think that's why
I have started hating you.

00:59:25.139 --> 00:59:26.019
Hey!

00:59:27.949 --> 00:59:29.109
What are you saying?

00:59:29.359 --> 00:59:33.469
How many times have I told you
not to compare Reena and Teju?

00:59:33.519 --> 00:59:35.539
Does everything revolve around you?

00:59:35.599 --> 00:59:36.519
I don't understand.

00:59:38.119 --> 00:59:39.649
You're very self-centred.

00:59:44.879 --> 00:59:46.429
What's the big deal?

00:59:46.629 --> 00:59:48.119
Are you going to break up with me?

00:59:49.139 --> 00:59:50.099
That's what I thought.

00:59:50.229 --> 00:59:52.349
If I say something,
you'll will say break up.

00:59:53.259 --> 00:59:56.699
You don't think about what
the problem is or how to solve it.

00:59:58.739 --> 01:00:00.099
You'll never change, Anitha.

01:00:14.059 --> 01:00:14.889
Hi, Anitha.

01:00:15.989 --> 01:00:17.809
Ma'am, what you're doing
is not right.

01:00:18.619 --> 01:00:19.749
What did I do?

01:00:19.999 --> 01:00:24.249
We used to work as a team
and handle everything.

01:00:24.339 --> 01:00:28.339
But now, you're prioritising
the interns and other juniors.

01:00:28.879 --> 01:00:31.159
Anitha, I treat everyone equally.

01:00:31.639 --> 01:00:32.509
No, ma'am.

01:00:33.389 --> 01:00:34.389
What do you mean?

01:00:35.269 --> 01:00:37.439
I've handed over my cases to you.

01:00:37.649 --> 01:00:40.209
In fact, I supported you
in the Ganga case.

01:00:40.479 --> 01:00:41.879
But what did you do in the end?

01:00:42.349 --> 01:00:44.389
You asked Reena
to assist the surgery.

01:00:44.499 --> 01:00:45.679
Anitha!
- Ma'am.

01:00:46.399 --> 01:00:47.499
Whatever you say, ma'am

01:00:47.899 --> 01:00:52.589
it's wrong to kick out people
who are already in the team.

01:00:53.149 --> 01:00:54.909
You're crossing the line, Anitha.

01:00:55.859 --> 01:00:57.889
I can suspend you
for talking like this.

01:00:57.969 --> 01:00:58.889
And you know that.

01:00:59.749 --> 01:01:01.979
Will you suspend me
if I ask for work, ma'am?

01:01:03.139 --> 01:01:04.099
Anitha.

01:01:05.629 --> 01:01:07.579
Reena prepared those records.

01:01:08.289 --> 01:01:12.079
You changed Meera's case, right?

01:01:14.589 --> 01:01:15.889
You changed it, right?

01:01:19.839 --> 01:01:20.809
I didn't do it, ma'am.

01:01:21.379 --> 01:01:22.789
Don't I know your handwriting?

01:01:23.639 --> 01:01:24.569
Anitha.

01:01:28.139 --> 01:01:30.689
When I inquired,
I found out that you did it.

01:01:32.569 --> 01:01:34.189
It's fine that you
don't work with me.

01:01:35.029 --> 01:01:37.629
But I've been observing
what you're doing.

01:01:48.629 --> 01:01:49.589
Anitha.

01:01:49.939 --> 01:01:53.039
You've been creating problems for
Reena so that you can work on cases.

01:01:53.289 --> 01:01:55.289
And what is this behaviour?

01:01:55.739 --> 01:01:58.209
And this is not you, Anitha.

01:02:02.889 --> 01:02:03.789
Ma'am.

01:02:05.519 --> 01:02:09.449
I don't have the importance that
I used to have in this hospital.

01:02:10.079 --> 01:02:13.839
To be honest, I don't
know what to do, ma'am.

01:02:15.139 --> 01:02:17.809
When all my cases go to Reena

01:02:18.859 --> 01:02:21.229
I think
she'll take my position, ma'am.

01:02:21.389 --> 01:02:22.279
Anitha.

01:02:23.079 --> 01:02:24.849
You're a potential doctor.

01:02:25.519 --> 01:02:27.229
You're getting overstressed now.

01:02:29.229 --> 01:02:32.389
Whatever you do in this mindset,
it won't go right.

01:02:32.639 --> 01:02:34.099
Take a break if you want.

01:02:36.279 --> 01:02:37.099
Oh.

01:02:37.569 --> 01:02:40.649
Do you call
a suspension as a break?

01:02:41.219 --> 01:02:43.479
I wouldn't be talking like this
if I wanted to suspend you.

01:02:45.719 --> 01:02:49.329
I can tell just by looking at you
just how frustrated you are.

01:02:51.169 --> 01:02:52.879
Consider this as a service.

01:02:53.409 --> 01:02:57.439
And be an example to all
the interns and resident doctors.

01:02:59.389 --> 01:03:02.919
This is not a competition to
compete against each other, Anitha.

01:03:03.279 --> 01:03:05.299
You need a break.
I think you need a break.

01:03:10.089 --> 01:03:11.059
Ma'am.

01:03:11.379 --> 01:03:13.669
If I need a break,
I'll ask for it myself.

01:03:15.389 --> 01:03:16.239
No, thanks.

01:03:30.269 --> 01:03:31.389
Why is he like this?

01:03:32.439 --> 01:03:33.769
I don't know what the problem is.

01:03:35.459 --> 01:03:36.309
So, Kiran.

01:03:36.689 --> 01:03:38.309
How was the food yesterday?

01:03:39.729 --> 01:03:40.559
It was good.

01:03:42.109 --> 01:03:42.949
But..

01:03:43.599 --> 01:03:45.499
Why did Reena talk
to your family about me like that?

01:03:46.509 --> 01:03:49.809
When she said it yesterday,
you were enjoying it.

01:03:50.039 --> 01:03:51.349
What happened now?
- Yes.

01:03:51.789 --> 01:03:53.789
I was hoping
that your family won't like me.

01:03:56.339 --> 01:03:57.229
But..

01:03:58.089 --> 01:04:00.239
She has been thinking about me
like this for a long time.

01:04:02.349 --> 01:04:03.309
It's nothing like that.

01:04:04.169 --> 01:04:06.389
They like you.
- How do you know?

01:04:07.069 --> 01:04:09.099
I heard it when she was
talking to my dad yesterday.

01:04:09.829 --> 01:04:10.689
Is it?

01:04:11.139 --> 01:04:12.059
What did she say?

01:04:13.909 --> 01:04:16.889
She said that she
likes your character.

01:04:19.059 --> 01:04:20.599
She was doing it to irritate you.

01:04:21.089 --> 01:04:22.589
You shouldn't take advantage of it.

01:04:23.939 --> 01:04:24.849
Correct.

01:04:26.769 --> 01:04:27.599
Nilofer.

01:04:28.269 --> 01:04:29.349
Are you telling me the truth?

01:04:34.829 --> 01:04:36.439
Thank you, Nilofer.
Thank you so much. - Okay.

01:04:44.419 --> 01:04:45.289
Hi.

01:04:45.729 --> 01:04:46.689
Hi, Arjun.

01:04:49.349 --> 01:04:50.279
Then?

01:04:50.709 --> 01:04:54.059
How was Manasa's birthday
dinner and celebration?

01:04:54.359 --> 01:04:55.309
It was great.

01:04:55.709 --> 01:04:57.099
We even cut a cake.

01:04:57.979 --> 01:04:58.979
Oh.

01:05:00.019 --> 01:05:01.629
Do you know when my birthday is?

01:05:03.479 --> 01:05:04.769
How could I not know that?

01:05:05.889 --> 01:05:06.769
Then?

01:05:07.019 --> 01:05:08.249
I didn't get a cake.

01:05:08.859 --> 01:05:11.139
I didn't buy a cake,
she had ordered it.

01:05:11.669 --> 01:05:12.639
Oh.

01:05:16.539 --> 01:05:18.399
We opened up to each other.

01:05:20.409 --> 01:05:23.479
She told me that she feels light
while talking to me.

01:05:24.269 --> 01:05:25.269
Oh.

01:05:25.939 --> 01:05:28.059
You've given counselling
to a psychologist.

01:05:32.749 --> 01:05:35.349
Then, you didn't ask me
how my day went.

01:05:36.589 --> 01:05:37.979
Kiran and I..
- Reena.

01:05:40.389 --> 01:05:41.519
What's happening between us?

01:05:42.539 --> 01:05:43.599
What do you mean?

01:05:44.759 --> 01:05:45.769
That's what I'm asking.

01:05:46.389 --> 01:05:47.229
Nothing.

01:05:49.639 --> 01:05:52.709
Then why are you talking about
Kiran whenever I talk about Manasa?

01:05:55.459 --> 01:06:00.669
I'm sharing what's happening
in my life, just like you're doing.

01:06:01.669 --> 01:06:05.439
So, there's nothing between us.

01:06:06.539 --> 01:06:09.019
No, I'm still angry with you.

01:06:09.129 --> 01:06:10.059
Oh.

01:06:10.639 --> 01:06:12.479
Okay..

01:06:12.869 --> 01:06:13.689
What's okay?

01:06:15.189 --> 01:06:16.099
Nothing.

01:06:16.429 --> 01:06:18.439
You always say this rudely.

01:06:19.939 --> 01:06:21.439
Now I think your anger has reduced.

01:06:21.709 --> 01:06:22.689
So what?

01:06:23.759 --> 01:06:25.059
That's what you always say.

01:06:25.489 --> 01:06:26.729
Time heals everything.

01:06:28.479 --> 01:06:30.669
Similarly, this problem also heals.

01:06:30.849 --> 01:06:32.379
Is that all I've said?

01:06:33.349 --> 01:06:34.829
I said that I trust you.

01:06:36.369 --> 01:06:37.589
You don't remember that, right?

01:06:38.279 --> 01:06:40.619
You don't remember anything
that happened after that, right?

01:06:41.689 --> 01:06:42.849
I didn't forget anything.

01:06:43.209 --> 01:06:45.339
I'm trying to forget it.

01:06:48.229 --> 01:06:51.459
Please don't remind me
of anything again.

01:06:55.449 --> 01:06:57.559
You can talk
to Manasa or anybody else.

01:06:57.689 --> 01:06:58.889
I'm not worried.

01:07:21.559 --> 01:07:22.599
How are you all?

01:07:25.019 --> 01:07:25.979
Look.

01:07:26.419 --> 01:07:28.539
You've made the situation worse.

01:07:29.229 --> 01:07:31.189
Do you know how many problems
you'll face because of this?

01:07:35.789 --> 01:07:37.919
If you hadn't revealed
that you took drugs

01:07:38.519 --> 01:07:40.019
you could've managed it somehow.

01:07:41.269 --> 01:07:42.269
But what to do?

01:07:43.999 --> 01:07:45.139
Now they know, right?

01:07:47.319 --> 01:07:48.939
Your sports career is over now.

01:07:57.889 --> 01:08:00.419
Because you tried to reveal
what happened in the institute

01:08:00.839 --> 01:08:02.839
I mixed cocaine in your food.

01:08:04.299 --> 01:08:06.379
Only your career will end.

01:08:06.619 --> 01:08:07.539
You're still young.

01:08:08.259 --> 01:08:10.379
You can look for other jobs
and make a living.

01:08:11.039 --> 01:08:11.939
But..

01:08:13.559 --> 01:08:17.219
If you try to reveal this again

01:08:18.889 --> 01:08:20.839
you won't have a chance
to look for another job.

01:08:22.349 --> 01:08:25.889
Because..
I'll kill all three of you.

01:08:31.509 --> 01:08:32.689
Whatever happened in the institute

01:08:33.729 --> 01:08:37.769
should remain in the institute.
Do you understand?

01:08:42.289 --> 01:08:43.439
Do you understand?

01:08:46.139 --> 01:08:47.599
Finish the treatment soon.

01:08:47.979 --> 01:08:49.809
And get out of this hospital.

01:10:01.789 --> 01:10:04.699
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:10:06.809 --> 01:10:09.449
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:10:11.909 --> 01:10:15.029
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:10:16.719 --> 01:10:18.979
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:10:19.319 --> 01:10:21.629
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:10:21.959 --> 01:10:24.479
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:10:24.669 --> 01:10:27.229
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:10:29.399 --> 01:10:32.149
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:10:34.399 --> 01:10:37.149
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:10:39.039 --> 01:10:43.219
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:11:06.219 --> 01:11:07.719
Hi Arjun.
- Hi.

01:11:08.979 --> 01:11:09.799
What?

01:11:10.839 --> 01:11:11.799
Nothing.

01:11:13.419 --> 01:11:14.299
Sorry.

01:11:15.909 --> 01:11:17.089
Why are you saying sorry?

01:11:17.859 --> 01:11:19.759
I shouldn't have spoken
to you like that yesterday.

01:11:20.059 --> 01:11:22.139
I thought we can forget
everything and be friends.

01:11:22.399 --> 01:11:25.969
I am the one who is talking
about it again and again. Sorry.

01:11:26.479 --> 01:11:27.549
Why are you sorry?

01:11:27.669 --> 01:11:29.049
Just accept it already.

01:11:29.329 --> 01:11:30.379
Is there any problem?

01:11:32.639 --> 01:11:33.509
No.

01:11:39.379 --> 01:11:40.679
Why are you looking
at me like that?

01:11:40.749 --> 01:11:43.339
But when you go out
with Manasa, I feel annoyed.

01:11:45.819 --> 01:11:47.589
I meant it as a friend.

01:11:49.989 --> 01:11:51.629
Okay, I forgot about it.

01:11:51.919 --> 01:11:53.009
You also forget it.

01:11:55.219 --> 01:11:56.129
Reena.

01:11:56.479 --> 01:11:58.419
I am not sad
about what happened yesterday.

01:11:58.649 --> 01:11:59.659
No?
- No.

01:12:00.159 --> 01:12:01.549
No?
- No.

01:12:02.139 --> 01:12:03.259
Then, give me back my apology.

01:12:09.299 --> 01:12:10.299
Then why are you so dull?

01:12:14.259 --> 01:12:16.919
I feel bad thinking
about the athletes' case.

01:12:17.839 --> 01:12:18.969
Is everything okay?

01:12:22.799 --> 01:12:23.919
I hope so.

01:12:29.709 --> 01:12:30.709
Abhi.

01:12:32.289 --> 01:12:33.169
Come here.

01:12:36.169 --> 01:12:37.039
What is it?

01:12:38.289 --> 01:12:40.339
No one in the hospital
has any doubt, right?

01:12:41.299 --> 01:12:42.169
I don't know.

01:12:43.969 --> 01:12:45.379
I didn't talk to anyone.

01:12:46.129 --> 01:12:49.969
I think Kamal is the only one
who has a doubt.

01:12:50.549 --> 01:12:51.379
Abhi.

01:12:51.759 --> 01:12:52.669
Be careful.

01:12:53.059 --> 01:12:55.669
If we get caught,
I will lose my job.

01:12:55.889 --> 01:12:57.719
Then I will go to jail.
- I will take care of it.

01:12:58.969 --> 01:12:59.879
Okay.

01:13:00.279 --> 01:13:02.219
Is there anything going on
between you and Kamal?

01:13:06.179 --> 01:13:07.219
Nothing.

01:13:09.509 --> 01:13:12.879
He is behaving weirdly with me.

01:13:13.419 --> 01:13:14.499
That's why I asked you.

01:13:14.869 --> 01:13:15.839
Why?

01:13:16.649 --> 01:13:17.759
Did he tell you anything?

01:13:17.909 --> 01:13:19.379
It's okay if he told me anything.

01:13:19.679 --> 01:13:21.219
But when I ask him for some help

01:13:21.419 --> 01:13:25.129
he is asking how we can be casual
after everything that happened.

01:13:25.339 --> 01:13:27.549
He is not telling me what it is.

01:13:29.019 --> 01:13:30.259
What happened?

01:13:31.399 --> 01:13:34.629
He told me that he likes me.

01:13:35.349 --> 01:13:37.049
Oh!
That's great.

01:13:37.489 --> 01:13:38.419
What did you tell him?

01:13:39.719 --> 01:13:40.839
I didn't tell him anything.

01:13:42.719 --> 01:13:43.669
Look here.

01:13:44.509 --> 01:13:46.089
He looks average.

01:13:46.259 --> 01:13:47.439
But he is a doctor.

01:13:47.879 --> 01:13:50.219
If you marry him and settle down

01:13:50.289 --> 01:13:52.129
there is a chance that
our problems will get solved.

01:13:52.279 --> 01:13:53.919
How can you think like this?

01:13:54.619 --> 01:13:56.669
Does anyone get married
for such a reason?

01:13:57.029 --> 01:13:58.169
That's what marriage is.

01:13:59.209 --> 01:14:00.129
I am not like that.

01:14:00.439 --> 01:14:01.279
Then, how?

01:14:01.459 --> 01:14:02.799
I can't tell you all that.

01:14:03.299 --> 01:14:05.629
You mind your business.

01:14:05.899 --> 01:14:07.669
Be careful with him.

01:14:08.279 --> 01:14:09.339
Stay away from him.

01:14:10.419 --> 01:14:11.339
Let's see.

01:14:22.299 --> 01:14:23.759
This is a complicated situation.

01:14:24.079 --> 01:14:28.549
Still, I am thinking about what
to do from my side and our side.

01:14:30.629 --> 01:14:31.629
Listen, Radhi.

01:14:31.689 --> 01:14:33.879
It's not my job to see
what you are doing.

01:14:35.839 --> 01:14:36.669
What happened, sir?

01:14:36.719 --> 01:14:38.589
I told you not to leak
the news about the athletes.

01:14:38.929 --> 01:14:41.839
Forget the news. We have to inform
the police as per protocol.

01:14:41.949 --> 01:14:42.839
Why didn't you do it?

01:14:43.169 --> 01:14:45.009
Sir, we have
to consider their future.

01:14:45.419 --> 01:14:46.509
Let's think about it.

01:14:46.769 --> 01:14:49.169
If we hide it now and
the news comes out tomorrow

01:14:49.219 --> 01:14:51.089
our hospital's reputation
will be ruined.

01:14:51.419 --> 01:14:53.299
Without the knowledge
of a chief doctor

01:14:53.529 --> 01:14:55.579
without the chief doctor knowing

01:14:55.799 --> 01:14:57.379
how can you break protocol?

01:14:57.419 --> 01:15:02.589
Sir, we have already done a few
things like this for our patients.

01:15:03.269 --> 01:15:05.549
Keep your concern aside, Arjun.

01:15:06.259 --> 01:15:08.919
If you decide it among yourselves,
what am I here for?

01:15:10.369 --> 01:15:12.669
It's like you are disrespecting me
and my position.

01:15:12.799 --> 01:15:14.759
Sir, that's not our intention.

01:15:15.369 --> 01:15:17.049
We are just handling the situation.

01:15:17.119 --> 01:15:18.369
That's what I am saying.

01:15:18.789 --> 01:15:20.709
If there is a situation
or problem like that

01:15:20.829 --> 01:15:22.709
you can come to me
to discuss and solve it.

01:15:23.229 --> 01:15:25.379
Why are you running
to the CEO for everything?

01:15:26.459 --> 01:15:27.289
Sir.

01:15:28.489 --> 01:15:30.299
If you think
I have disrespected you

01:15:30.979 --> 01:15:32.899
I'm sorry, sir.
We didn't mean it that way.

01:15:33.209 --> 01:15:35.339
But this is what has
happened till now.

01:15:36.039 --> 01:15:39.089
But we will ensure that
this doesn't happen again.

01:15:40.969 --> 01:15:44.669
We can discuss things
in the future and decide.

01:15:47.689 --> 01:15:48.559
Ma'am.

01:15:49.299 --> 01:15:50.259
Sure, Arjun.

01:15:54.239 --> 01:15:55.339
I don't want this again.

01:16:04.829 --> 01:16:05.939
Hi.
- Hey.

01:16:07.809 --> 01:16:09.589
Why are you here?
What if someone sees us?

01:16:09.959 --> 01:16:11.839
I will handle it
if someone sees us.

01:16:14.949 --> 01:16:16.009
What do you want now?

01:16:16.419 --> 01:16:18.369
I just wanted
to talk to you casually.

01:16:20.419 --> 01:16:21.799
Don't play your mind games
with me.

01:16:21.909 --> 01:16:23.919
I am not playing any mind games.

01:16:24.959 --> 01:16:27.159
So, Brother..
- Hey.

01:16:28.799 --> 01:16:30.919
How many times have I
told not to call me that? - Hey.

01:16:32.099 --> 01:16:33.259
You are my brother.

01:16:34.279 --> 01:16:37.049
What do you think about Arjun?

01:16:37.599 --> 01:16:38.459
What do you know about him?

01:16:41.279 --> 01:16:42.259
That's what I thought.

01:16:43.399 --> 01:16:45.259
I know him professionally.

01:16:45.689 --> 01:16:47.919
But I know very little
about him personally.

01:16:48.959 --> 01:16:50.089
What do you want to know?

01:16:51.349 --> 01:16:52.379
You're coming to the point.

01:16:52.949 --> 01:16:55.589
I want to know about
his relationship. Tell me.

01:16:56.619 --> 01:16:57.759
Why do you want to know that?

01:16:59.679 --> 01:17:03.259
He tells me everything about
himself, except his relationship.

01:17:04.419 --> 01:17:06.079
What are you going to do
after knowing that?

01:17:06.259 --> 01:17:08.459
I'm just curious.

01:17:10.299 --> 01:17:11.509
What is there to be curious about?

01:17:12.019 --> 01:17:13.949
First, tell me what I asked you.

01:17:16.669 --> 01:17:18.779
Arjun and Reena used to date.

01:17:19.669 --> 01:17:21.549
Because of Arjun's mistake

01:17:22.169 --> 01:17:23.709
Reena is not talking
to him properly.

01:17:24.679 --> 01:17:27.339
Now, I think
they are getting closer.

01:17:28.729 --> 01:17:29.759
Getting closer?

01:17:32.389 --> 01:17:34.459
That's what it looks like.

01:17:40.169 --> 01:17:43.299
Why are you so eager
to know about Arjun?

01:17:44.369 --> 01:17:46.509
It was my birthday yesterday.

01:17:46.839 --> 01:17:47.709
Hey.

01:17:48.219 --> 01:17:49.089
Happy birthday.

01:17:49.269 --> 01:17:50.419
Oh.
Yuck.

01:17:52.859 --> 01:17:54.209
We had gone for dinner.

01:17:55.509 --> 01:17:56.419
Dinner?

01:17:57.869 --> 01:17:58.839
With Arjun?

01:17:59.909 --> 01:18:02.129
Hey, how did you become a doctor?

01:18:03.069 --> 01:18:04.209
Arjun and I.

01:18:05.699 --> 01:18:07.589
So, we spoke about a lot of things.

01:18:09.109 --> 01:18:11.299
Did he tell you
anything about Reena?

01:18:13.499 --> 01:18:14.759
He kind of did.

01:18:15.979 --> 01:18:18.629
He looks smart.

01:18:19.789 --> 01:18:20.669
So?

01:18:20.989 --> 01:18:23.419
I mean..
He is an interesting guy.

01:18:26.139 --> 01:18:27.969
Listen, don't.

01:18:28.269 --> 01:18:31.259
Hey, don't talk like an old man.

01:18:31.989 --> 01:18:32.819
Go.

01:18:33.619 --> 01:18:37.089
All the patients here are waiting
for you to save them.

01:18:37.569 --> 01:18:38.629
Go and do your work.

01:18:50.119 --> 01:18:51.629
Do you know what happened to you?

01:18:52.409 --> 01:18:54.219
Do you know why
you got admitted here?

01:18:54.469 --> 01:18:57.049
Did you think that using
cocaine is a simple thing?

01:18:58.179 --> 01:19:01.169
You might have wanted to boost your
performance and increase your speed.

01:19:02.169 --> 01:19:05.129
But in just a second, your heart
would have stopped beating.

01:19:07.099 --> 01:19:08.919
Your blood pressure
would have increased

01:19:08.939 --> 01:19:10.759
and your veins
would have started bursting.

01:19:12.009 --> 01:19:13.469
You can't do anything.

01:19:15.129 --> 01:19:18.129
Is this why you have so
much training and records?

01:19:21.979 --> 01:19:23.969
I didn't want to ask you.
But I couldn't.

01:19:25.699 --> 01:19:26.669
Why did you take drugs?

01:19:27.909 --> 01:19:29.049
Don't you know that it is illegal?

01:19:30.049 --> 01:19:30.919
Your coach..

01:19:31.219 --> 01:19:32.399
Let it be.

01:19:32.889 --> 01:19:35.089
Did you think about what
your parents would think?

01:19:36.199 --> 01:19:38.379
They are waiting
for you to run and win.

01:19:39.009 --> 01:19:41.259
Others get inspired by you.

01:19:42.229 --> 01:19:43.299
What will happen to them?

01:19:43.759 --> 01:19:45.089
Nothing will happen to you now.

01:19:46.169 --> 01:19:47.259
You will be fine in a few days.

01:19:47.719 --> 01:19:48.719
It is the same medication.

01:19:49.249 --> 01:19:51.469
Physically, you will be fine.
But mentally?

01:19:55.759 --> 01:19:57.629
Take care of yourself.
- Doctor.

01:19:57.959 --> 01:19:59.539
There was a steroid in our..
- Hey.

01:20:05.419 --> 01:20:06.539
Please, Doctor.

01:20:06.799 --> 01:20:08.339
Don't ask us anything more.

01:20:10.919 --> 01:20:13.089
Did anyone compel you
to take drugs?

01:20:16.169 --> 01:20:17.009
Viji.

01:20:28.169 --> 01:20:32.509
Amaya..
- Doctor.

01:20:33.399 --> 01:20:36.049
I have updated the reports
as per Dr. Radhi's instructions.

01:20:36.429 --> 01:20:37.969
Follow the dosage as per that.

01:20:40.169 --> 01:20:41.379
Give them the first dose now.

01:20:56.849 --> 01:20:57.719
Teju.

01:20:58.999 --> 01:21:00.129
Something is not right.

01:21:00.439 --> 01:21:02.969
I think those three girls
are trying to say something.

01:21:03.859 --> 01:21:04.759
What else?

01:21:05.299 --> 01:21:07.299
They will try
to justify what they did.

01:21:07.629 --> 01:21:08.469
No, Teju.

01:21:08.779 --> 01:21:09.699
Then?

01:21:10.299 --> 01:21:11.919
Don't you have any suspicions
regarding this case?

01:21:13.129 --> 01:21:14.259
I am asking you seriously.

01:21:15.349 --> 01:21:16.219
No.

01:21:16.849 --> 01:21:18.169
I don't have any suspicions.

01:21:18.309 --> 01:21:19.469
But why do you have one?

01:21:20.509 --> 01:21:22.469
When I went to give
medication to them

01:21:23.569 --> 01:21:26.379
those three girls tried to say
something about steroids.

01:21:27.029 --> 01:21:29.049
But they got anxious
as soon as the coach entered.

01:21:30.089 --> 01:21:31.419
Something is wrong.

01:21:33.919 --> 01:21:35.419
I want to talk to them.

01:21:35.799 --> 01:21:36.799
You have to help me.

01:21:36.989 --> 01:21:39.259
Hey, why are you asking me that?

01:21:39.459 --> 01:21:41.969
Teju, I am asking you to help me
because we are in the same team.

01:21:45.489 --> 01:21:46.379
Okay.

01:21:46.559 --> 01:21:47.629
We will see during our rounds.

01:21:48.299 --> 01:21:49.839
But the coach will be there.

01:21:50.159 --> 01:21:51.629
He won't be there all the time.

01:21:52.039 --> 01:21:53.089
Let's go and talk to them.

01:21:54.859 --> 01:21:56.299
But we have to do it soon.

01:22:02.599 --> 01:22:04.799
Sir, give me these medicines.

01:22:17.049 --> 01:22:18.049
Who is it now?

01:22:19.189 --> 01:22:21.799
You are taking the medicines
without checking them.

01:22:22.009 --> 01:22:24.879
Would anyone commit a mistake
in such a big hospital?

01:22:25.739 --> 01:22:27.009
Will you commit a mistake?

01:22:27.219 --> 01:22:28.249
No, madam.

01:22:30.459 --> 01:22:31.339
Wait.

01:22:32.049 --> 01:22:33.049
Prescription.
- Take it.

01:22:41.449 --> 01:22:43.299
Look this medicine is wrong.

01:22:43.329 --> 01:22:45.009
No, ma'am,
it's the same combination.

01:22:45.219 --> 01:22:46.169
But it's a different brand.

01:22:46.639 --> 01:22:47.459
Then?

01:22:47.789 --> 01:22:50.469
Won't you inform the doctors
that this is what you have?

01:22:50.899 --> 01:22:52.509
S-Sorry, ma'am. That is..
- What?

01:22:54.419 --> 01:22:55.259
Do one thing.

01:22:55.449 --> 01:22:57.289
Inform the doctors
that this is the brand you have.

01:22:57.459 --> 01:23:00.339
Get it signed by Dr. Radhi.
- Okay, ma'am.

01:23:08.799 --> 01:23:09.969
Take this and go.

01:23:13.419 --> 01:23:14.339
Thank you.

01:23:27.899 --> 01:23:28.839
Sir.

01:23:30.389 --> 01:23:31.239
Sir.

01:23:31.329 --> 01:23:33.339
Joseph's eyes are critical.

01:23:34.549 --> 01:23:36.469
Why are you laughing, sir?
- Tell me.

01:23:37.049 --> 01:23:38.669
The vitals are abnormal.

01:23:38.839 --> 01:23:40.339
Shall we increase the dosage?

01:23:54.209 --> 01:23:55.049
Sir.

01:23:55.699 --> 01:23:57.339
Why are we laughing like a fool?

01:23:57.879 --> 01:23:58.879
Who are you calling a fool?

01:23:59.309 --> 01:24:00.299
I meant myself, sir?

01:24:00.519 --> 01:24:02.549
I'm laughing like a fool.

01:24:07.789 --> 01:24:09.529
Everyone thinks I'm stupid.

01:24:10.719 --> 01:24:12.339
You are a little insecure.

01:24:15.059 --> 01:24:17.089
I've had this problem
for a long time.

01:24:17.749 --> 01:24:19.759
I found a way to get rid of it.

01:24:21.129 --> 01:24:24.169
Sir, you find kidney stones
without a scan.

01:24:24.289 --> 01:24:26.589
Is it a big deal for you to find
a solution for this problem?

01:24:30.029 --> 01:24:31.379
You seem to be very happy.

01:24:31.949 --> 01:24:32.969
I don't understand anything.

01:24:35.969 --> 01:24:36.849
I'm stupid.

01:24:37.919 --> 01:24:38.879
Insecurity.

01:25:00.479 --> 01:25:03.089
Hello, sir.
- 'How many times will you call me?'

01:25:03.279 --> 01:25:05.189
'Don't you know that I'd be
in a meeting if I'm not answering?'

01:25:05.259 --> 01:25:07.919
Sir, I am very scared.

01:25:11.189 --> 01:25:13.469
Is Amaya the only nurse here?

01:25:13.799 --> 01:25:14.969
Isn't there anyone else?

01:25:18.509 --> 01:25:20.419
I don't know what this medicine is.

01:25:22.719 --> 01:25:23.629
This is the one.

01:25:46.419 --> 01:25:47.919
Amaya, what are you doing?

01:25:49.189 --> 01:25:50.299
What are you doing?

01:25:51.449 --> 01:25:54.759
Dr. Radhi had asked Dr. Reena
to change the medication.

01:25:54.979 --> 01:25:57.239
She asked me to give the first
dose now and I'm doing it.

01:25:57.289 --> 01:25:58.169
Give it.

01:25:58.819 --> 01:26:01.039
Don't you know how to give
medication to a patient?

01:26:01.839 --> 01:26:03.419
Go and get their files.

01:26:20.279 --> 01:26:22.299
What is there in the file?
What are you giving them?

01:26:22.899 --> 01:26:24.419
I gave what Dr. Reena
asked me to give.

01:26:24.669 --> 01:26:27.419
Not only that, Manasa
also cross-checked it.

01:26:28.109 --> 01:26:30.379
Manasa is not
a medical professional like us.

01:26:30.669 --> 01:26:32.689
She is a psychiatrist
and she is doing her job.

01:26:32.849 --> 01:26:34.589
If you give this to the patient
based on her opinion

01:26:34.619 --> 01:26:36.759
who will take
responsibility for it?

01:26:39.459 --> 01:26:41.169
Go and get
the patient's medicine tray.

01:26:42.829 --> 01:26:43.669
Oh, God!

01:26:43.739 --> 01:26:45.629
Every time, someone comes
and saves me.

01:26:47.759 --> 01:26:50.129
What are you doing? Go!

01:26:52.889 --> 01:26:53.879
Here you go, Doctor.

01:27:02.499 --> 01:27:04.459
I will take care of this patient.

01:27:04.569 --> 01:27:08.049
You prepare the discharge summary
for the patient in bed no. 15.

01:27:32.569 --> 01:27:33.459
Doctor.

01:27:34.269 --> 01:27:36.089
They called you
to the ER immediately.

01:27:36.149 --> 01:27:37.129
What happened?

01:28:03.849 --> 01:28:05.049
What happened?

01:28:05.829 --> 01:28:09.169
Ma'am, these three girls are dead.

01:28:09.949 --> 01:28:10.799
What?

01:28:11.759 --> 01:28:12.669
How?

01:29:15.599 --> 01:29:16.919
What do we do now, ma'am?

